# Claude Code
# Most of .claude/ is machine-local agent state, but a few paths are shared so
# all contributors -- and the sandcastle in-sandbox agents -- inherit them:
# settings.json (team hooks/permissions) and the committed hooks/ scripts.
# settings.local.json and worktrees/ stay machine-local via the .claude/* glob.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/

# Project-specific
# Reference documents (not committed, but available locally for agents)
references/

